#: scenario7:scenario7_A61B843E_6FBB_4813_AB1A_9706B0A29741
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f38d5b2f51712f41b39a50c207891894729ee0c7ff416636d04cc581236e6934
