msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Doesn’t it seem a bit unfair, Michel?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You tore down the walls around Giselle’s "
"heart, around her past,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫米歇尔……⟪k:1⟫你不觉得自己太狡猾了吗。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫你把吉赛儿的过去——⟪k:4⟫把她的心伤都挖了出来。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_66CA2B35_CBEA_453C_B4CA_045F2AA56432
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
