msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫We’d long since left paved roads behind. The carriage rocked back and forth as it proceeded "
"down the rough dirt path."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫没有铺装的粗粝土道，⟪k:1⟫让马车时左时右地使劲摇晃。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_F0C6902E_68FE_4483_BBB0_C7DD7DF9C42B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8b9a3bba1bb0ea118b819826c93cf94c91a9cf6537987ab04ec79a571dba2f2b
#. default-sha256: 5818a523d141d91ed369312be4149056a6cb129569ff5e5de1a2a381a9ec5261
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_F0C6902E_68FE_4483_BBB0_C7DD7DF9C42B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫For hours, I stared through the window as unfamiliar scenery flowed past."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫我一直眺望着窗外陌生的景色。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_79A48CB2_9C49_44A6_B40B_44E15C9C445D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 99f83305a8a37ed201a8656f194d373abab2e75472135e2f2474ae6bf1cd8782
#. default-sha256: 7788daabf67d3a2f6f9ac424c6122454f1213c232619c016c5c126ee99516234
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_79A48CB2_9C49_44A6_B40B_44E15C9C445D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Eventually, a fog settled over the area, making it difficult to discern night from day."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫渐渐起了雾——⟪k:1⟫世界变得混沌暧昧，⟪k:2⟫分不清黑夜白天。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_0E088A47_52C1_4581_B41B_BF40C33F08E2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5a984557396d12b7724ae62ab358236f4734dbfdb0c450a1dead7f3c61768fe0
#. default-sha256: 0ba9e542a639df4ec1f0e89df4cbee16b51cc7c9c61fc0080d2845a9a7a5ea07
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_0E088A47_52C1_4581_B41B_BF40C33F08E2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫We made our way through dark, dense woods,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫我们穿过葱郁而阴暗的森林——"

#: scenario7:scenario7_359143BE_5C80_42FC_B167_2C23C3273733
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8cd39404a11dd08107224f46bcd0fd6baad70acc68f3a41ce4fd09c8cf660396
#. default-sha256: 9d64a2492afcb9c4cb5613710f3ef36297f1c1a4731852cc4939a0b8fbc530e4
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_359143BE_5C80_42FC_B167_2C23C3273733"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫and beyond them, like the world fading into view after a dream,⟪k:1⟫a mansion appeared "
"before us."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫那座洋馆，⟪k:1⟫犹如海市蜃楼一般突然出现在眼前。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_DC8ACA79_CAB1_4942_82B7_958A94631B2D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f5aaccd31ace0bc854c83257030b52febe6b70ee90d5a7dfcb181ed7c3f02baf
#. default-sha256: ac081ff7f4049970df1bd767a77f04cd15051bb46e279b4b3c3582089d95456c
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_DC8ACA79_CAB1_4942_82B7_958A94631B2D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫All the windows were either shuttered or boarded, encasing the house in darkness. "
"⟪k:3⟫In a way, it felt like all I had done was move from one prison to a much larger one."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫所有窗户都被木板钉死了，⟪k:3⟫看起来阴森恐怖……⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫令我想起家中的幽禁生活。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_07AD7681_D31A_46C2_A2B1_605FBAB4690C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d2f112d59306416785d9d8729f086d79d7406c99666c7f46ca3a9ad3ed90197b
#. default-sha256: 5b84ae1eaebc24a4a4a0fd3c59cd5e23db3e89a49f5132a859a78d340f04afd3
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_07AD7681_D31A_46C2_A2B1_605FBAB4690C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Briefly, I thought they had possibly been sealed to keep anyone from seeing me inside, but "
"my coming here was a very recent development."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫本以为是避免我被人看到，⟪k:1⟫才封住了窗户——⟪k:2⟫但我来这里是临时决定的。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_09D5BBD6_AEEE_44A9_A23E_95B5BEA18C65
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f036ec1fcd94f7c9ad73615119ebc947d3772d882f97a32b09e8acac0944cf03
#. default-sha256: 0e77873ab6f39e1a0a7f387edbd6e77ea45adec264008c43918d80f4e7d68eae
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_09D5BBD6_AEEE_44A9_A23E_95B5BEA18C65"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫More likely, then, the house had been in this condition when it was initially purchased."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫那么，⟪k:1⟫这座洋馆一开始就是这样的。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫恐怕买来的时候就是这样了……"

#: scenario7:scenario7_E5FACC8E_63AE_45FE_84F5_08E44CF718B3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 79bfcd2866fea34635a92ea4ccb8e95dbe8df51d02426299685dfe368e34161f
