msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………"

#: scenario7:scenario7_A85997A7_0A43_4642_A58B_D0231ACAB0AB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d7109a6da0d483627ae5f1062bbc20e5d7cb27040550d580a591fb529e550cd3
#. default-sha256: 82fbdeed77e2a5a8b7a0b927c4dd685a083088c29c3f7efee0536e8f7a198ec0
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_A85997A7_0A43_4642_A58B_D0231ACAB0AB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I spent some time just staring out at the forest, but naturally, there was nothing of "
"interest to be found there. ⟪k:1⟫So I quietly turned around and opened the door to the mansion."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫我眺望了一阵子林海的景色——⟪k:1⟫虽然这并不能改变什么。⟪k:2⟫于是我默默地打开洋馆的门。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_1F5B5544_F2BD_4AE1_B168_AD9BCD0A2CC4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dc4922d38bb48c02de526f678cd75f12b5b1cc1a6074bcc3494c8ee678b28615
#. default-sha256: 510935644067ceb09a939e51cc1820430e22cff497acbf8e53a9cdb67b1a93cf
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_1F5B5544_F2BD_4AE1_B168_AD9BCD0A2CC4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫It’s certainly dark..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫好黑啊……"

#: scenario7:scenario7_A39B9906_8B03_44F8_9562_BC3F44C5F944
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 82ad2e8aff2506923375d075c82d7e543e24f4f12fc011679fefe5f6df2251d1
#. default-sha256: a4d7755a08d3ce33e9e972ff4ebd0724cd77a4929a913164a5bb881a2db1da81
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_A39B9906_8B03_44F8_9562_BC3F44C5F944"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I could barely even see my own feet."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫黑得连脚下都看不清，⟪k:1⟫整个洋馆都被黑暗支配。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_FA3122C7_CEF1_4641_81FC_8FC5C9F108D4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7192008f2a36443df1d81b460f9a7183adcb83ca494c79b09adbe51a6e94c19b
