"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Examining the large room I found myself in,⟪k:9⟫I "
"came across a stained-glass window depicting an angel."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫我环视一个宽阔的房间，⟪k:9⟫发现了画着天使的彩绘玻璃。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_BABA6C9B_0ECB_4777_BA6C_CD417E6912E2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e2f394fae9d6e6c799ddb0b5cb7b46cfb4b6734e7b12d7a5c4911d57bbaf4609
